  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile settings and scvi_n200 RNA encoder (e.g., config_036) achieve high accuracy. This experiment tests the impact of replacing the image encoder (imagenet_vit_l → resnet50) while keeping other components (scvi_n200 RNA, avgpool aggregation, concat fusion) consistent. This isolates the effect of image encoder choice, a critical design decision, and could clarify whether resnet50 offers better performance than imagenet_vit_l in this context."
}

